- https://github.com/axios/axios/security/advisories/GHSA-6chq-wfr3-2hj9
- https://osv.dev/vulnerability/GHSA-6chq-wfr3-2hj9
- Related patch area: `lib/adapters/http.js`, `lib/helpers/resolveConfig.js`
</details>

